      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "B",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[On the Xth of the week, X days in the month X, year 3 of the sabbatical cycle], which is year 4 thousand and 693 A.M.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... Na\u1e25]man [...] gave [...] gold\u2026\u20145 din.,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] 2 \u2026\u20145 d(i)n., a veil and a long scarf\u2014[.] di[n.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] a Sa\u02bf\u012bd\u012b [bed] cover\u20143 din., 13 pillows\u2014[.] di[n.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] one [din.,] a pail, a cup, a dyeing vessel</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]\u201415 din., 2 chests\u20144 di[n.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... And al]so she brought in from her father\u2019s house one portion</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] ground level, second level, and th[ird] level, to the south\u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] and to the west, [the] house of \u2026; to the north</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] mixed, not divided. [And these] apartment are conveyed with every righ[t],</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[exposed and concealed \u2026 which are th]eirs. They are [her] mo[har] and dowr[y]\u2014ninety</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] and pros[p]er. Qayyom b. Simeon ha-Kohen ha-Yaman\u012b.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] ha-Kohen b. Isaac</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Isaac b. Har\u016bn, witness. Mena\u1e25em b. Sam-</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">-uel. Abraham b. Saadiah, witness.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
